sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as Backend API (Controllers)
    participant Svc as Services
    participant Repo as Repositories
    participant ORM as DbContext / ORM
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>API: HTTP request (REST/GraphQL)
    API->>Svc: validate + auth
    Svc->>Repo: business logic -> data request
    Repo->>ORM: build query / ORM call
    ORM->>DB: SQL executed
    DB-->>ORM: rows / result
    ORM-->>Repo: mapped entities
    Repo-->>Svc: domain objects
    Svc-->>API: response DTO
    API-->>Client: HTTP response (JSON)
